			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140240201,
					"content": "「僕人」…還有「公子」！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240202,
					"content": "喂，你不是回至冬養傷去了嗎？怎麼還在楓丹呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240203,
					"content": "噢，兩位，沒想到還能在這裡再見面…咳咳、咳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240204,
					"content": "從原始胎海離開後，我昏迷了很久。再次醒來時，發現自己正被送往至冬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240205,
					"content": "這怎麼行？我在楓丹還有沒做完的事情。於是我強撐著爬起來，又一個人回來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240206,
					"content": "嗯？什麼事情？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240207,
					"content": "關於「絲柯克」…我的師父。我很想見她一面，可惜等我回來的時候，她已經離開了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240208,
					"content": "我還有很多問題想問她。沒辦法，只好拜託「僕人」幫我查查師父的蹤跡。她既然來了楓丹，應該會留下些蛛絲馬跡才對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240209,
					"content": "原來如此，那你們找到什麼線索了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240210,
					"content": "很遺憾。雖然壁爐之家可以搞定絕大部分情報，但面對那樣的存在，我們也無可奈何。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240211,
					"content": "說到底，還是師父認為現在沒有見我的必要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240212,
					"content": "不過這個問題也容易解決。只要我變得更強…咳咳、咳咳咳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240213,
					"content": "你還是先把傷養好再說吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240214,
					"content": "哈哈，我已經好得差不多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240215,
					"content": "多虧了壁爐之家。那個叫埃盧瓦爾的孩子配了些亂七八糟的藥劑給我，喝了之後渾身都疼，但恢復速度的確快了不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240216,
					"content": "這次真的要道別了。老爺子派人來催了，讓我回去參加什麼計畫…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240217,
					"content": "「嚴冬計畫」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240218,
					"content": "對對。唉，聽說還有「富人」的事，我可不想回去聽他的長篇大論。不然妳想個辦法，讓我在楓丹多待一段時間？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240219,
					"content": "我還是覺得教林尼他們武藝比較有趣，如果妳能和我切磋一下就更好了，我還沒見過妳全力以赴的樣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240220,
					"content": "想多了。我也在接下來的計畫中，用不了多久就會從這裡離開。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240221,
					"content": "再說，那些留在至冬的富商政要點名要你回去，不也是一種「榮耀」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240222,
					"content": "哈哈…饒了我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240223,
					"content": "感覺這兩個人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240224,
					"content": "一本正經地在背後議論同事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240225,
					"content": "所以，兩位壁爐之家的「客人」，來找我做什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240226,
					"content": "啊…這個…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240227,
					"content": "想多瞭解一下壁爐之家的「父親」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240228
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240228,
					"content": "沒錯！我們跟林尼他們已經很熟了，反倒是對妳還不怎麼瞭解呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240229,
					"content": "是嗎？我記得自己做過自我介紹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240230,
					"content": "那種簡短的自我介紹有什麼用啦，起碼告訴我們，為什麼妳要自稱「父親」吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240231,
					"content": "哦，好問題！我其實也想知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240232,
					"content": "既然你們都不知道，說明我們的情報工作做得很好，應該繼續保持下去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240233,
					"content": "不愧是外交官啊，輕易就化解了我們的進攻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240234,
					"content": "沒事的話，我就先回去了，家裡還有件麻煩事要處理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240235,
					"content": "欸…欸！等一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240236,
					"content": "（如果「僕人」就這麼回去的話，可能會正好撞上林尼和克雷薇…！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240237
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240237,
					"content": "（要放飛林尼的魔術飛鳥嗎？不，在那之前，先試著尋找一些別的話題吧。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240238,
						140240239
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240238,
					"content": "關於壁爐之家…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240240
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240240,
					"content": "哦，這個問題我也有點好奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240241,
					"content": "我和壁爐之家那些孩子們接觸過，他們都是些好孩子。見到他們，我就會想起冬妮婭和托克。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240242,
					"content": "如果有一天妳「背叛」了他們，我一定會找妳打一架。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240243,
					"content": "我為什麼會背叛他們？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240244,
					"content": "我聽說妳已經背叛過一次「壁爐之家」了，不知道是真是假。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240245,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240246,
					"content": "好吧，我承認，是老爺子…就是「公雞」告訴我的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240247,
					"content": "（背叛…難道說克雷薇說的是真的嗎？「僕人」她把壁爐之家的孩子當做實驗品？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240248
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240248,
					"content": "妳、妳真的對那些孩子做過什麼壞事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240249,
					"content": "比起我做過什麼，我更想聽聽偉大的「公雞」先生是如何評價我的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240250,
					"content": "我想想啊，大致就是解決掉了許多「同伴」、最後還對「親人」動手之類的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240251,
					"content": "哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240252,
					"content": "看妳的反應，這些傳聞是假的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240253,
					"content": "不，雖然這種表述我不太喜歡，但也算是事實。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240254,
					"content": "嚴格來講，算是某種偏見。我暫時不打算澄清，偏見會將真相包裹起來，對我來說是一件好事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240255
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240255,
					"content": "就像我經常自稱「楓丹人」，但我只是在楓丹長大而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240256
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240256,
					"content": "啊？？妳、妳不是楓丹人嗎？那妳為什麼要幫楓丹度過危機？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240257
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240257,
					"content": "在楓丹做事，這個身分比較好用，不會被懷疑是別有用心。誰不想拯救自己的家鄉呢？我真正想要保護的，是那些出身楓丹的孩子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240258
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240258,
					"content": "#原始胎海對我沒有影響，但會給壁爐之家帶來損失。希望我透露的資訊可以滿足{F#妳}{M#你}們的好奇心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240259
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240259,
					"content": "（僕人主動聊起自己的秘密，將話題從「背叛壁爐之家」上引開了。她似乎還不願意提起自己的過去…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240260
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240260,
					"content": "既然妳為了他們留在楓丹，那我相信妳不會背叛那些「孩子們」…抱歉，之前我對妳的看法有些偏頗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240261
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240261,
					"content": "我說了，這是一件好事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240262
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240262,
					"content": "說起來，在壁爐之家養傷的時候，我還聽說了一件很對我胃口的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240263
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240263,
					"content": "據說在壁爐之家，每次家人出現爭執的時候就會打一場，輸的一方要主動做出讓步。那豈不是可以經常光明正大地切磋？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240264
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240264,
					"content": "你說的是近些年的事情，更早的時候可沒有這麼美好，輸的一方會失去一切，包括自己的生命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240265
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240265,
					"content": "這麼危險！幸虧改掉了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240266
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240266,
					"content": "現在的氛圍我很喜歡，或者說有點羨慕。妳有這麼多家人，而且可以和他們生活在一起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240267
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240267,
					"content": "家人太多，就會開始吵鬧，開始勾心鬥角。等冬妮婭和托克都進入叛逆期，你就明白這種感受了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240268
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240268,
					"content": "想像一下：托克迷上了拔「公雞」的鬍子，冬妮婭把自己的頭髮染出四十二種顏色…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240269
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240269,
					"content": "停停，我完全能夠理解了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240270
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240270,
					"content": "聊到冬妮婭和托克，「公子」立刻打開話匣子，滔滔不絕地講起故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240271
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240271,
					"content": "往常聽到最後可能會打瞌睡，這次卻由衷地感謝他幫忙拖延了時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240272
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140240272,
					"content": "一晃都到這個時間了，我該走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240273
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240273,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}、派蒙，下次不知道會在哪裡再見。到時候有機會的話，我們再比試一番…咳咳、咳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240274
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240274,
					"content": "都說啦，你還是先把傷養好再說吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240275
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240275,
					"content": "好、好。還有，這次多謝妳了，阿蕾奇諾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240276
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240276,
					"content": "不客氣，拿到神之心有你的一份貢獻，我們互不相欠。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240277
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240277,
					"content": "這樣也不錯。那我走了，下次再會，各位。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240278
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240278,
					"content": "我們也走吧…妳要跟我們一起回去嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240279
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240279,
					"content": "#怎麼，{F#妳}{M#你}們希望我現在就走？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240280
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240280,
					"content": "啊…這個…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240281
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240281,
					"content": "晚風很舒適，我留下來思考一些事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240282
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240282,
					"content": "#招待不周，敬請諒解。希望{F#妳}{M#你}們住得開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140240239,
					"content": "妳是怎麼看待壁爐之家的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140240240
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
